  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "旁白",
    "words": "小栞把圖鑑交由取回書籤的初音來保管。\\n幾天後。{0}被初音約到蘭德索爾，\\n和小栞一同交代整件事情的原委。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": null
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "經過這次事件",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_000",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "【動物苑】和【森林守衛】就",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "魔物圖鑑與書籤的處理一事\\n進行了協商。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "\\n今天",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "結果將會出爐。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "（最後，看來是決定交由精靈之森來嚴加看守。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_001",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "\\n圖鑑和書籤都已經不在我這裡了。）",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_002",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "小栞……明明是很難得的禮物，真對不起哦？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_003",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "姊姊又沒有錯不需要道歉啦。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_004",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "不如說，謝謝妳還為了我……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "嗚……小栞小栞小栞",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_005",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "姊、姊姊……{0}也是，真的非常感謝你。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_006",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "\\n幫了這麼多的忙……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "要是沒有{0}的話根本無法解決。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_007",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "哇──！想去想去！對了！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_008",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "\\n我們之前不是做了下次三個人一起去的約定嗎！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "呵呵，說的對……那麼恭敬不如從命，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_009",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "\\n我們就來一場小小的慶功宴吧……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "欸欸，小栞妳想去哪裡？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_010",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "光是一個圖鑑就讓我用盡了體力和腦力，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_011",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "機會難得我想吃點甜品……好嗎。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "啊我也想吃！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_012",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "好，那麼我們就向甜品店出發吧♪",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "background",
    "bg_id": "500050"
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "嗯～♪好吃～♪來啊，小栞妳也來一口！啊～",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_013",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "♪",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "啊唔……真、真難為情啊姊姊……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_014",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "啊～……嗯，好好吃喔。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "欸嘿嘿，不愧是小栞挑的店呢！妳經常來嗎？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_015",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "欸……那個，姊姊，其實呢……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_016",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "女性",
    "words": "這位客人。請收下這個。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_017",
    "unit_id": 411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "咦？什、什麼什麼？這個是……枕頭嗎？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_018",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "是我悄悄交給店員的。所以我才挑了這間店。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_019",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "\\n想說來個驚喜的……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "小栞！這是！這是……！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_020",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "姊姊……一直以來謝謝妳了。這是我要送給妳的……禮物。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_021",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "我也是，從很多人那裡聽說了，姊姊非常努力。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "……小、小……小栞！謝謝妳～！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_022",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "\\n我太開心了！我一定會一直一～直好好珍惜它的！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "啊啊。對了！我必須回信給妳啊 ！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_023",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "結果到最後還是沒把回信寫好！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "姊、姊姊，這個禮物本來就是我要送給妳的。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_024",
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "栞",
    "words": "\\n姊姊再送我禮物的話，就要變成回禮的回禮了？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103811
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "初音",
    "words": "就算這樣我還是想給妳啊！　欸欸～！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_5001007_025",
    "unit_id": 101211
  },
